  "prefLabel": "Lab 1001.05 \"Youth employment certificate\", as required by RSA 276-A: 5, means the document which is issued to a youth by a principal, or authorized representative, of a sc",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1001.05 \"Youth employment certificate\", as required by RSA 276-A: 5, means the document which is issued to a youth by a principal, or authorized representative, of a school in New Hampshire or by a parent or legal guardian of the youth upon the receipt of an Employer's Request for Child Labor Form and proof of age.\n\nSource. #10931, eff 9-15-15 (from Lab 1001.04); ss by #13222, eff 6-26-21",
